    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……あるファンの方の言葉なんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『たとえ本人にでも、自分の大事なアイドルを\r\n実際より低く見積もられるのは嫌だ』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "というようなことを言われた時は、\r\nなかなか痺れましたねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──……！）",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "それは、なんというか……\r\n厳しい言い回しですね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから自信を持ってほしいとか、自分を認めてほしいとか、\r\nそういうニュアンスなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰のことよくわかってる激励っていうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……たとえば、今の三峰を否定することは、\r\n三峰を応援してくれる人たちを傷付けることになる",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "誰だって、誰かの大切なものを雑に扱って\r\n傷付けたくはないじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "ええ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから、これを聞いた時に、\r\n必要以上に縮こまるのはやめようって思いましたね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうやって、うまーく封じてくれちゃったんです\r\n三峰の、逃げとか。弱いところを",
