    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もちろん、何も失敗しないに越したことはないんですが──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もし私が何かで失敗してしまったとしても、\r\n『それじゃダメだよ』って注意してくれる──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700309/1007003090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003090170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そうやって、心から私を見てくれる人がいる",
